# Gamelog - User Auth

###
# @name 1. 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "테스트유저",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###
# @name 2. 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

